    "assessment": "This pinned snapshot supplies level-one q-expansion, coefficient reduction, Hasse invariant, filtration/weight congruence and Serre p-adic weight infrastructure. PAdic/Classical embeds rational classical forms into Serre p-adic forms; it is not a Galois crystalline comparison theorem. No Galois, crystalline or Fontaine-Laffaille implementation was located in this complete fetched Lean-source snapshot. The eigenvariety/classicality description in the README is not accepted as a proved endpoint. No external proof closure was built or accepted; no root pins changed.",
